stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Queued: submit
  Queued --> Running: stream opens
  Running --> Streaming: message_delta
  Streaming --> Completed: run_completed
  Queued --> Cancelled: cancel
  Running --> Cancelled: cancel
  Running --> Failed: provider/agent/tool failure
  Running --> AwaitingApproval: high-risk action
  AwaitingApproval --> Running: matching approved request
  AwaitingApproval --> Cancelled: expires or cancelled
